/**
 * The single duplicate check for a new owner. All duplicate detection is consolidated into one derived
 * {@code identityKey} (see {@link OwnerIdentity}): a new owner is rejected with a 409 Conflict only when
 * its WHOLE identity key — normalized telephone, email and household id together — equals an existing
 * owner's. This replaces the separate telephone, email and household checks: because the telephone is
 * part of the key, two members of the same household with different telephones now have different keys
 * and are both allowed; only an exact full-key match is a duplicate.
